  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Manage Scholarships Operations Phase 3 Future State Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity,&#xa0;following on from the Scholarships Improvement Project and the transition of the operational management of the Manaaki New&#xa0;Zealand Scholarship Programme (MNZSP) from MFAT to Education New Zealand (ENZ), aims to enhance operational management of the MNZSP delivered by ENZ towards our agreed Future State. ENZ will engage with current providers of the MNZSP to manage the change progression from Design to Implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
